Event examples from the TEXT, JOIN, KICK, QUIT, NICK and Ctcp Events pages
of mIRC's help.

-- events.mrc --
on 1:TEXT:*help*:#mirc,#irchelp:/msg $nick what is the problem?
on 1:JOIN:#:/msg $chan Welcome $nick
on 1:KICK:#:/invite $knick $chan | /msg $nick Hey, $knick is my friend!
on 1:QUIT:/notice $me $nick just quit IRC with the message $1-
on 1:NICK:/describe $newnick thinks $nick was a nicer nickname!
ctcp 1:ping:?:/notice $nick Ouch! | /halt
-- transcript --
me trout
chan #trout @trout bob alice
active #trout
< :bob!u@h PRIVMSG #mirc :I need help
> /msg bob what is the problem?
< :bob!u@h PRIVMSG #trout :I need help
< :dave!u@h JOIN #trout
> /msg #trout Welcome dave
< :alice!u@h KICK #trout bob :bye
> /invite bob #trout
> /msg alice Hey, bob is my friend!
< :dave!u@h NICK :davey
> /describe davey thinks dave was a nicer nickname!
< :davey!u@h QUIT :Gone fishing
> /notice trout davey just quit IRC with the message Gone fishing
< :bob!u@h PRIVMSG trout :\x01PING 123\x01
> /notice bob Ouch!
* halted
< :bob!u@h PRIVMSG #trout :\x01PING 123\x01
